 randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n- **Scoring Mode:** Beat your high score and test your stealth and survival skills in a franatical collecting run!\n- **Hard Story Mode:** You know all the tricks and locations but want a bigger challenge? Try the unforgiving hard mode and test your skills even more!", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n![{\"height\":720,\"type\":\"video\",\"width\":1280}](https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.7195-25/499315353_1521524865935480_3557572908950688983_n.mp4?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=b20b63&_nc_ohc=i4E8GwQ9liEQ7kNvwHD5qU4&_nc_oc=AdotOz_SyPW1_FeaZH7z36tXaNhQtxR4zIolJXzYX3y2M8PGXSYJXhM24X0MxJkvtcY&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_gid=oOErAfBmPNxNgW6jdg6kTQ&_nc_ss=7f22e&oh=00_AQTLJNOYIUONmTLiFGtj1hrn9IMIg2ui3IjhALXKlis3Rw&oe=6AF148F0)\n\n# Why you will fear the dark\n\n- **Changing Nightmare:** Item locations are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals mo